<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-jinshu" book-id="b-jinshu-031" chapter-id="c-jinshu-031-jin043-shantao" source-id="s-jinshu-031-jin043-shantao">
  <p id="c-jinshu-031-jin043-shantao:zhang" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-jinshu-031-jin043-shantao:zhang:m0000" ref="l69_zy8_tmk">宣穆張皇后</persName>諱<persName id="c-jinshu-031-jin043-shantao:zhang:m0006" ref="l69_zy8_tmk">春華</persName>，河內平皋人也。父<persName id="c-jinshu-031-jin043-shantao:zhang:m0017" ref="snw_ypx_j41">汪</persName>，魏粟邑令；母河內<persName id="c-jinshu-031-jin043-shantao:zhang:m0027" ref="p2a_yw3_7mk">山氏</persName>，司徒<persName id="c-jinshu-031-jin043-shantao:zhang:m0032" ref="96a_987_925">濤</persName>之從祖姑也。</p>
  <p id="c-jinshu-031-jin043-shantao:yang" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-jinshu-031-jin043-shantao:yang:m0000" ref="5mf_0mr_7v3">武元楊皇后</persName>諱<persName id="c-jinshu-031-jin043-shantao:yang:m0006" ref="5mf_0mr_7v3">艷</persName>，字<persName id="c-jinshu-031-jin043-shantao:yang:m0009" ref="5mf_0mr_7v3">瓊芝</persName>，弘農華陰人也。</p>
</text>
